WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.791
The Plan tab: balance, concurrency and rates

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:08.773
Click Add Balance and enter an amount

00:00:08.773 --> 00:00:11.585
GST is added; Proceed to Pay opens checkout

00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:19.194
Redeem a coupon

00:00:19.194 --> 00:00:25.775
Click Change concurrency and pick a value

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:31.221
Click Update, then Confirm

00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:36.203
Transactions lists every payment

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:39.855
A failed payment added nothing; pay again
